---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';
import { site } from '../content/site';

const updated = 'August 2026';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy notice"
  description="How US Telecom Services collects, uses and protects the information you send through this website."
  hideCta={true}
>
  <PageHeader eyebrow="Legal" title="Privacy notice" lead={`Last updated ${updated}.`} />

  <section class="py-16 sm:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 sm:px-8">
      <div class="prose-usts text-lg" style="color: var(--text-body)">
        <p>
          This notice covers <strong>www.usts1.com</strong>, operated by {site.legalName} (trading as
          US Telecom Services). It explains what we collect through this website and what we do with it.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-12 text-2xl">What we collect</h2>
        <p>Only what you type into a form. There are two:</p>
        <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
          <li>
            <strong>The contact form</strong> — your name, company, email, phone, the topic you pick and your
            message.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>The employment application</strong> — your name and contact details, home address, work
            eligibility answers, the role and market you want, your experience, pay expectation, education,
            availability, employment history, driving and transportation answers, how you heard about us,
            and your resume if you attach one.
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          <strong>We deliberately do not ask for your Social Security number, date of birth or gender on
          this website.</strong> If we make you a conditional offer, that information is collected later
          through our internal onboarding process, where it belongs.
        </p>
        <p>
          We do not run advertising trackers or third-party analytics on this site, and we do not sell or
          rent your information to anyone.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-12 text-2xl">Why we hold it and for how long</h2>
        <p>
          Contact messages are used to answer you and are kept as ordinary business correspondence.
          Applications go into our internal recruiting system so our hiring team can assess you, contact
          you, and consider you for later openings. If you would rather we did not keep your application on
          file, say so and we will remove it.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-12 text-2xl">Text messages</h2>
        <p>
          If you tick the box on the application, we may send you automated texts about your application.
          Message and data rates may apply. Reply <strong>STOP</strong> at any time to opt out — it does not
          affect how we consider your application.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-12 text-2xl">Who else sees it</h2>
        <p>
          Our staff who need it, and the service providers who run our systems on our behalf — principally
          Microsoft, which hosts this website and our business applications in the United States. We share
          information otherwise only where the law requires it.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-12 text-2xl">How it is protected</h2>
        <p>
          The site is served over HTTPS. Form submissions travel encrypted and are written directly into our
          internal systems, which are access-controlled and require multi-factor authentication. The account
          this website uses to file your application can create an applicant record and read the list of open
          roles — nothing else.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-12 text-2xl">Cookies</h2>
        <p>
          This site sets no tracking or advertising cookies. The application form saves your progress in your
          own browser's local storage so you can come back to a part-finished application; that data stays on
          your device and is cleared when you submit.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-12 text-2xl">Your choices</h2>
        <p>
          You can ask us what we hold about you, ask us to correct it, or ask us to delete it. Email{' '}
          <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`} class="privacy-link">{site.email}</a> and we will respond.
          Depending on where you live you may have additional rights under state law, including in
          California — we will honor those requests regardless of where you live.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-12 text-2xl">Equal opportunity</h2>
        <p>
          US Telecom Services is an equal opportunity employer. We do not discriminate on the basis of race,
          color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, age, disability,
          veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by law.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-12 text-2xl">Contact</h2>
        <p>
          {site.legalName}
          <br />
          {site.mailing.street}, {site.mailing.city}, {site.mailing.state} {site.mailing.zip}
          <br />
          <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`} class="privacy-link">{site.email}</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .privacy-link {
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }
  .prose-usts h2 {
    color: var(--text-strong);
  }
</style>
